   ->  Gather Motion 12:1  (slice1; segments: 12)
         ->  Partial Aggregate
               ->  Parallel Seq Scan on filt
                     Filter: (a < 0)
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
(6 rows)

:check filt where a < 0;
 rows | sum_a | misaligned | sum_rownum 
------+-------+------------+------------
    0 |       |            |           
(1 row)

explain (costs off) :check filt where a > 0;
                    QUERY PLAN                    
--------------------------------------------------
 Finalize Aggregate
   ->  Gather Motion 12:1  (slice1; segments: 12)
         ->  Partial Aggregate
               ->  Parallel Seq Scan on filt
                     Filter: (a > 0)
