 Finalize Aggregate
   ->  Gather Motion 12:1  (slice1; segments: 12)
         ->  Partial Aggregate
               ->  Parallel Seq Scan on filt
                     Filter: ((a % 10) = 3)
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
